<title>USA: CWM Mortgage names Angelo Mozilo CEO.</title>
<headline>CWM Mortgage names Angelo Mozilo CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>-- CWM Mortgage Holdings, Inc said Wednesday that it named  Angelo R. Mozilo to assume the role of chief executive officer,</p>
<p>In order to &quot;facilitate the promotion of other senior executive officers,&quot; David Loeb has resigned as chief executive. Loeb will remain as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Michael Perry, president and chief operating officer, has assumed the role of president.</p>
</text>
